    "items": [
      {
        "type": "heading2",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Psalm 48"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "The Beauty and Glory of Zion."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "A Song; a Psalm of the sons of Korah."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          1
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Great is the Lord, and greatly to be praised",
          "In the city of our God, His holy mountain."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          2
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Beautiful in elevation, the joy of the whole earth,",
          "Is Mount Zion in the far north,",
          "The city of the great King."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          3
        ],
        "lines": [
          "In its palaces,",
          "God has made Himself known as a stronghold."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          4
        ],
        "lines": [
          "¶For, behold, the kings arrived,",
          "They passed by together."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          5
        ],
        "lines": [
          "They saw it, then they were amazed;",
          "They were terrified, they fled in a hurry."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          6
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Panic seized them there,",
          "Anguish, as that of a woman in childbirth."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          7
        ],
        "lines": [
          "With the east wind",
          "You smash the ships of Tarshish."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          8
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Just as we have heard, so have we seen",
          "In the city of the Lord of armies, in the city of our God;",
          "God will establish her forever."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Selah"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          9
        ],
        "lines": [
          "¶We have thought over Your goodness, God,",
          "In the midst of Your temple."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          10
        ],
        "lines": [
          "As is Your name, God,",
          "So is Your praise to the ends of the earth;",
          "Your right hand is full of righteousness."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          11
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Mount Zion shall be glad,",
          "The daughters of Judah shall rejoice",
          "Because of Your judgments."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          12
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Walk around Zion and encircle her;",
          "Count her towers;"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          13
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Consider her ramparts;",
          "Go through her palaces,",
          "So that you may tell of her to the next generation."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          14
        ],
        "lines": [
          "For such is God,",
          "Our God forever and ever;",
          "He will lead us until death."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      }
    ]
  },
